<p>It isn't hard work, exactly. It's endless work. And it adds up.</p>

<h2 id="four-choices">Until recently, there were only four choices</h2>
<p>For most of the years we've owned our homes, keeping a porch clean meant picking one of these:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>The broom.</strong> Free, and slow. Twice a day in the fall.</li>
